{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wVlKqbpw2K1794754784.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位傍晚發生火警，一名婆婆不適。</p><p></p><p>火警後，逾150名住戶要疏散到室外暫避，消防車和救護車到場救援。警方傍晚近六時半接獲大廈保安報案，指16樓一個單位火警， 一名92歲婆婆吸入濃煙不適，經初步治理，毋須送院。</p><p></p><p>據了解，婆婆事發時將電飯煲誤當作煮食煲，放上煮食爐上燃燒，導致失火。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:43:16.237277+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T19:50:19.067543+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:36:43.416171+00:00","content_hash":"ef570af1598a95d0f1afea672e7d69645e46f73d5b8e916a1f1367c40391926a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:43:16.237277+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}